  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Partnership on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities Multi Partner Trust Fund.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for joint projects between UN Agencies, Civil Society Organisations, Organisations for Persons with Disabilities and government. Main countries are Nepal, Bangladesh, Armenia, Ukraine, Moldova, The Democratic Republic of the Congo, Ghana, Kenya, Mozambique, Rwanda, Sierra Leona, Tanzania, Zambia, Zimbabwe, Colombia and Guatemala.</narrative>
  </description>
